(FACTORYFLOW - ORDER-TO-AUDIT MANUFACTURING ERP DESIGN NOTE \(PAGE 1 OF 2\)) Tj
T* (====================================================================================) Tj
T* (1. ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW & TECHNOLOGY STACK) Tj
T* (  Frontend : React 18.3, TypeScript 5.6, Tailwind CSS 3.4, Vite 6.4 PWA) Tj
T* (             \(IndexedDB factoryflow_offline_db + Service Worker public/sw.js\)) Tj
T* (  Backend  : Python 3.13, FastAPI 0.115, SQLAlchemy 2.0 \(Decimal & PG NUMERIC\),) Tj
T* (             Pydantic v2, Alembic \(0001-0008\), PyJWT + bcrypt RBAC.) Tj
T* (  Roles    : 5 mandatory business roles \(admin, owner [read-only], order_manager,) Tj
T* (             floor_supervisor, auditor\) plus optional qa_inspector.) Tj
T* (  Database : Managed Neon PostgreSQL 16 \(sslmode=require, psycopg v3\). Independent) Tj
T* (             report reconciliation verifies StockLedger, StockBalance, Production,) Tj
T* (             Invoices, Dispatches, Payments, and PaymentAllocations directly.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. CORE ENTITY RELATIONSHIPS \(ORDER-TO-AUDIT TRACEABILITY\)) Tj
T* (  USERS ----------------> SALES_ORDERS ---> INVOICES \(1:1 immutable\) & DISPATCHES) Tj
T* (  PRODUCTS -------------> BOM_HEADERS \(versioned\) ---> BOM_LINES ---> STOCK_ITEMS) Tj
T* (  PRODUCTION_RUNS \(pins bom_id & snapshot\) ---> PRODUCTION_MATERIALS / EXPENSES) Tj
T* (  STOCK_ITEMS ----------> STOCK_BALANCES \(1:1 projection\) & STOCK_LEDGER \(append-only\)) Tj
T* (  CUSTOMERS ------------> PAYMENTS ---> PAYMENT_ALLOCATIONS ---> INVOICES) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. APPEND-ONLY STOCK LEDGER & WEIGHTED-AVERAGE VALUATION) Tj
T* (  - Immutability: StockLedger enforces SQLAlchemy before_update/before_delete hooks;) Tj
T* (    corrections emit traceable REVERSAL rows referencing source document IDs.) Tj
T* (  - Valuation: Avg Cost = \(Old Value + Receipt Value\) / \(Old Qty + Receipt Qty\).) Tj
T* (    Benchmark Flour: \(100 kg * 42 + 60 kg * 45\) / 160 kg = Rs 43.125/kg \(Rs 6,900\).) Tj
T* (  - Historical cut-off reports \(as_of_date\) replay StockLedger rows <= cutoff_dt.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4. BOM SNAPSHOTS, CONSUMPTION & PRODUCTION VARIANCE ENGINE) Tj
T* (  - Runs scale BOM lines and pin bom_id + bom_version_snapshot; later BOM versions) Tj
T* (    do not alter historical runs. Consumed qty = actual_qty + damaged_qty.) Tj
T* (  - Output posts actual_good_output to Finished Goods and warns on unpacked packets.) Tj
T* (  - Variance % = \(\(Actual - Planned\) / Planned\) * 100 against 3% tolerance bands:) Tj
T* (    GREEN \(<2.25%\), ORANGE \(2.25%-3.00%\), RED \(>3.00% exceeding tolerance\).) Tj
T* (  - Benchmark Run: Yield -6% \(188/200\), Oil +5% \(10.5/10\), Pouches -3% \(188+6=194\),) Tj
T* (    Cartons -10% \(9/10 -> warning: 8 packets remain unpacked\), Closing FG = 238 pkts.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (====================================================================================) Tj
T* (Page 1 of 2 - FactoryFlow Architecture, Ledger & BOM Production Design) Tj
ET
