(FACTORYFLOW - ORDER-TO-AUDIT MANUFACTURING ERP DESIGN NOTE \(PAGE 2 OF 2\)) Tj
T* (====================================================================================) Tj
T* (5. ACTUAL WEIGHTED-AVERAGE PRODUCTION COSTING & MARGIN) Tj
T* (  - Material & packaging cost reads StockLedger PRODUCTION_ISSUE \(actual, not plan\):) Tj
T* (    Flour 1,725 + Oil 1,470 + Spice 240 + Pouches 485 + Cartons 135 = Rs 4,055.00.) Tj
T* (  - Overheads read posted ProductionExpense rows: Labour Rs 1,200 + Power/Gas Rs 600) Tj
T* (    = Rs 1,800.00. Total Run Cost = Rs 5,855.00 / 188 good pkts = Rs 31.143617) Tj
T* (    \(Display Rs 31.14\). Pre-GST Unit Profit = Rs 50.00 - 31.143617 = Rs 18.86) Tj
T* (    \(Gross Margin 37.71%\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (6. STATE-AWARE GST CALCULATION, SHORTAGE CONTROL & DISPATCH ISOLATION) Tj
T* (  - Compares factory state \(Tamil Nadu, 33\) against customer Place of Supply:) Tj
T* (    Intra-state splits 5% GST equally \(2.5% CGST + 2.5% SGST\):) Tj
T* (      Retailer A \(TN\) 150 * 50 = Rs 7,500 + CGST 187.50 + SGST 187.50 = Rs 7,875.) Tj
T* (    Inter-state applies 5% IGST:) Tj
T* (      Distributor B \(KA\) 120 * 50 = Rs 6,000 + IGST 300 = Rs 6,300 preview.) Tj
T* (  - Order approval locks StockBalance FOR UPDATE: Retailer A dispatches 150 pkts) Tj
T* (    \(FG 238 -> 88\); Distributor B \(120 vs 88\) is held in AWAITING_STOCK \(shortage) Tj
T* (    32 pkts\) with billing & dispatch blocked \(HTTP 422\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (7. POSTGRESQL ROW-LOCKED PAYMENTS, RECEIVABLES & AUDIT REPORTING) Tj
T* (  - Payment allocation executes PostgreSQL SELECT ... FOR UPDATE OF payments and) Tj
T* (    FOR UPDATE OF invoices, enforces unique \(payment_id, invoice_id\), prevents) Tj
T* (    over-allocation, and reconciles Rs 7,875 - Rs 4,000 paid = Rs 3,875 outstanding) Tj
T* (    across 5 ageing buckets \(Current, 1-30d, 31-60d, 61-90d, >90d\).) Tj
T* (  - 15 read-only Auditor & Owner reports + CSV/XLSX/PDF exports verify DB totals.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8. OFFLINE PWA SYNCHRONIZATION & IMMUTABLE AUDIT TRAIL) Tj
T* (  - IndexedDB stores non-sensitive session metadata & timestamped price catalog only) Tj
T* (    \(zero passwords/JWT secrets\). POST /api/v1/orders/sync enforces unique) Tj
T* (    idempotency_key \(safe replay duplicate=true\), submits strictly as SUBMITTED) Tj
T* (    without offline invoicing/dispatch, and flags stale prices as NEEDS_REVIEW.) Tj
T* (  - Immutable audit_logs record actor, role, action, resource_id & IP \(no DELETE\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (====================================================================================) Tj
T* (Page 2 of 2 - FactoryFlow Costing, GST, Row-Locked Payments & Offline Design) Tj
